WEBVTT

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:00.294
for example. So it's like I'm going to a concert hall,

00:03:00.294 --> 00:03:02.505
because I can listen to the paintings.

00:03:02.505 --> 00:03:04.966
And supermarkets, I find this is very shocking,

00:03:04.966 --> 00:03:07.916
it's very, very attractive to walk along a supermarket.

00:03:07.916 --> 00:03:09.404
It's like going to a nightclub.

00:03:09.404 --> 00:03:12.660
It's full of different melodies. (Laughter) Yeah.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:14.735
Especially the aisle with cleaning products.

00:03:14.735 --> 00:03:18.086
It's just fabulous. (Laughter)

00:03:18.086 --> 00:03:20.558
Also, the way I dress has changed.

00:03:20.558 --> 00:03:22.966
Before, I used to dress in a way that it looked good.

00:03:22.966 --> 00:03:27.543
Now I dress in a way that it sounds good. (Laughter)

00:03:27.543 --> 00:03:32.674
(Applause)